        "text": "Step 4: Solve the quadratic equation using the quadratic formula \\( x = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a} \\), where \\( a = 1 \\), \\( b = 5 \\), and \\( c = -52 \\):\n\\[ x = \\frac{-5 \\pm \\sqrt{5^2 - 4 \\cdot 1 \\cdot (-52)}}{2 \\cdot 1} \\]\n\\[ x = \\frac{-5 \\pm \\sqrt{25 + 208}}{2} \\]\n\\[ x = \\frac{-5 \\pm \\sqrt{233}}{2} \\]"
