        "text": "Step 6: Calculate the product of the \\( y \\)-values:\n\\[ \\left( \\frac{113 - 5\\sqrt{233}}{2} \\right) \\left( \\frac{113 + 5\\sqrt{233}}{2} \\right) \\]\n\\[ = \\frac{(113 - 5\\sqrt{233})(113 + 5\\sqrt{233})}{4} \\]\n\\[ = \\frac{113^2 - (5\\sqrt{233})^2}{4} \\]\n\\[ = \\frac{12769 - 5750}{4} \\]\n\\[ = \\frac{7019}{4} \\]"
